"""F5 (isolated from the intra-turn ordering floor): ONE act, on turn one,
that the world says happens in two days and takes five minutes.  On a
separate turn an hour later she tries to make a two-minute phone call.
`not_before` is None on that turn, so the only thing that can move it is
busy_until."""
import json, sys
