"""F5c: the same arithmetic deletes a valid act.  Ada plans one thing for
the last day of the window; from that moment she counts as occupied, so the
message she actually sends an hour later is pushed past the cutoff, dropped
entirely, and the drop is then used as evidence that the deadline passed
with nothing happening (NO_AT_CUTOFF)."""
import json, sys
